  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>模組說明</strong></span></h1>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>為強化下界合金增添最終裝備，整合所有下界合金裝備的能力。</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#59150f\"><strong>終焉下界合金</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#59150f\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b99f3529-a4c4-4273-b301-979189cf5a02.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\"><br><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">終焉下界合金擁有以下所有下界合金的能力：</span></strong></span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#11513f\"><strong>末影下界合金</strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>羽饰下界合金</strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>烈焰下界合金</strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">黃金下界合金</span></strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>幽靈下界合金</strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#082508\"><strong>中毒下界合金</strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>水流下界合金</strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2d2d2d\"><strong>凋靈下界合金</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><strong><span>注意：</span></strong></h2>\n<p><strong><span>本模組需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enhanced-netherite-xianziyu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">強化下界合金</span></a> 1.2.0 或更高版本。</span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
